      {
        "topic": "创建任务函数",
        "id": "0394b092f103bf36",
        "direction": 1,
        "children": [
          {
            "topic": "osThreadId_t osThreadNew (osThreadFunc_t func, void *argument, const osThreadAttr_t *attr)",
            "id": "0394b2696e2c2aef"
          },
          {
            "topic": "osThreadId_t 为返回值，其实就是在操作该任务时候的句柄",
            "id": "03baf7618facb774"
          },
          {
            "topic": "参数 1：osThreadFunc_t func           这是任务函数，类似于线程函数",
            "id": "03b98fb61e1fd8d4"
          },
          {
            "topic": "参数 2：void *argument                   给任务函数传的参数，不传填 NULL",
            "id": "03b992e7de2bff35"
          },
          {
            "topic": "参数 3：const osThreadAttr_t *attr  任务相关的属性值，包括任务名字、优先级、栈空间大小等",
            "id": "03b9942d5c2a7158"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "topic": "挂起与释放任务",
        "id": "0394b9a5f36d71fc",
        "direction": 1,
        "children": [
          {
            "topic": "void vTaskSuspend( osThreadId_t xTaskToSuspend );                                 功能：挂起任务参数：xTaskToSuspend\t                                                      要挂起的任务句柄。若传递 NULL，表示挂起当前正在执行的任务自身。",
            "id": "0394bf4564af9e5e"
          },
          {
            "topic": "void vTaskResume( osThreadId_t xTaskToResume );                                        功能：恢复任务参数：xTaskToResume\t                                                        要恢复的任务句柄。必须是此前通过",
            "id": "03b9a9525762e38d"
          },
          {
            "topic": "vTaskSuspend() 挂起的任务",
            "id": "03b9ae555d72f95b"
          },
          {
            "topic": "osStatus_t osThreadTerminate(osThreadId_t thread_id);                            参数：任务的句柄",
            "id": "03b9af60da8683e4"
          }
        ]
      },
